// The hover tooltip tells you a block is in trouble before it gives way: a wood span under a
// deep sand pile reads as cracking within a few ticks; the granite floor reads as idle.
map
#########################################
###ssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss####
###ssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss####
###ssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss####
###ssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss####
###ssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss####
###ssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss####
###bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb####
#..................................######
#..................................######
#..................................######
#..@...............................######
#########################################
end
expect 5 strain:15,-4 == 4           // mid-span: cracking
expect 5 strain:0,1 == 0             // the floor under the mole carries nothing worth a warning
expect 300 strain:10,0 == 0          // fallen debris is loose: no strain line
